[{"id":177251930,"discussion_id":"535c76b75d2558b28dcd526fb5fb1c2cd704bce1","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n Apricityh, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-26T10:42:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T10:42:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177251931,"discussion_id":"1df821b6da7c68652a8fd1fbc8afe3c55e3bc484","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234), [*唐玮玮*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/2) | ✅ [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234), [*唐玮玮*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)","created_at":"2026-06-26T10:42:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T14:12:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177259847,"discussion_id":"4638a945e57daa10e0b26a45cbe8d1dc6a61fce7","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `embedding_bag_apt.cpp` 中 SIMT PROMOTE 路径下 `DTYPE_OFFSETS` 宏类型不匹配的问题。当 `DTYPE_INDICES` 为 `int32_t` 时，PROMOTE 场景需要将 offset 类型提升为 `int64_t`，但原先直接使用 `DTYPE_OFFSETS` 宏会导致该宏被展开为与 `DTYPE_INDICES` 相同的类型而无法正确提升。此改动通过引入 `if constexpr (std::is_same<DTYPE_INDICES, int64_t>::value)` 编译期分支，根据 `DTYPE_INDICES` 的实际类型来正确选择 offset 模板参数（`int32_t` 或 `int64_t`），同时 REGBASE 1D PROMOTE 和 SIMT EMPTY PROMOTE 路径也一并做了相应修正。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **SIMT 1D PROMOTE 路径修复**: 为 `TILING_KEY_SIMT_1D_PROMOTE_INT32` 和 `TILING_KEY_SIMT_1D_PROMOTE_INT64` 两个分支添加 `if constexpr` 编译期判断，替代原先的 `DTYPE_OFFSETS` 宏，确保模板类 `EmbeddingBagRegBaseSimt1D` 的第三个模板参数在 `DTYPE_INDICES` 为 `int64_t` 时取 `int32_t`，否则取 `int64_t`。\n\n- **SIMT 2D PROMOTE 路径修复**: 为 `TILING_KEY_SIMT_2D_PROMOTE_INT32` 和 `TILING_KEY_SIMT_2D_PROMOTE_INT64` 两个分支同样添加 `if constexpr` 编译期判断，正确选择 `EmbeddingBagRegBaseSimt2D` 的 offset 模板参数类型。\n\n- **REGBASE 1D PROMOTE 路径修复**: 为 `TILING_KEY_INDICES_1D_PROMOTE` 分支添加 `if constexpr` 分支，使得 `EmbeddingBagRegBaseIndx1dSum`/`Mean`/`Max` 的第三模板参数根据 `DTYPE_INDICES` 实际类型正确推断。\n\n- **SIMT EMPTY PROMOTE 路径修正**: `TILING_KEY_SIMT_EMPTY_PROMOTE_INT32` 和 `TILING_KEY_SIMT_EMPTY_PROMOTE_INT64` 路径中，将 `EmbeddingBagRegBaseSimtEmpty` 的第一个模板参数从 `DTYPE_INDICES` 直接改为 `int64_t`，因为 PROMOTE 场景下 indices 类型固定为 `int64_t`。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T11:05:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T11:05:00+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177265114,"